{
  "case": "09-blob-referenced-once",
  "contract": "LogicalUsageV1",
  "algorithm_version": 1,
  "description": "A page with one image node referencing one durable file.",
  "covers": [
    "D21",
    "D40"
  ],
  "input": {
    "account": "acct-1",
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "documents": [
          {
            "document": "doc-1",
            "listing": {
              "kind": "file",
              "trashed_at": null
            },
            "durable": true,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "n1",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 0,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Quarterly plan",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 14
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "n2",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 1,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "image",
                "text": "",
                "name": "Diagram",
                "blob": "wbi-ws1-0001",
                "mime": "image/png",
                "runs": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "blobs": [
          {
            "dedup_identity": "wbi-ws1-0001",
            "verified_plaintext_length_bytes": 1048576,
            "durable": true,
            "note": "1 MiB of plaintext (an internal engineering figure, so binary and spelled MiB); the length is verified from the authenticated envelope framing (D40)"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "derivation": [
    "workspace ws-1 (ENABLED):",
    "    doc-1/n1 (paragraph): node.text 14 = 14",
    "    doc-1/n2 (image): node.name 7 = 7",
    "  document doc-1: 21",
    "  blob wbi-ws1-0001: durable, referenced -> 1048576",
    "  -> documents_units 21 + files_bytes 1048576 = 1048597",
    "account: documents_units 21 + files_bytes 1048576 = 1048597"
  ],
  "expected": {
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "workspace_state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "usage_state": "OK",
        "documents_units": 21,
        "files_bytes": 1048576,
        "logical_usage_units": 1048597,
        "algorithm_version": 1
      }
    ],
    "account": {
      "usage_state": "OK",
      "documents_units": 21,
      "files_bytes": 1048576,
      "logical_usage_units": 1048597,
      "algorithm_version": 1
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "The image node pays only for its authored display name (\"Diagram\", 7 characters). Its existence, its mime token and the blob reference itself are all free; the file's plaintext bytes are the whole of files_bytes.",
    "verified_plaintext_length comes from the authenticated ciphertext framing minus fixed versioned overhead, derived by the authorized workspace actor at the durability verify step (D40). Blob.size is never read.",
    "With structure free, files are now almost the whole bill for an account like this one: 1 048 576 of 1 048 597."
  ]
}
